OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome blustery showers possible
OL,6,Fover the north of Tayside and Angus
OL,7,Fwhich may be wintry over higher
OL,8,Fground. Drier further south and over
OL,9,FCentral parts with patchy cloud giving
OL,10,Flong sunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay mostly dry with
OL,13,Fclear spells through the evening and
OL,14,Fovernight. The odd shower remains
OL,15,Fpossible in the north during the
OL,16,Fevening. A cold frosty night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
