OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith some bright or sunny intervals,
OL,7,Fthe best of these in the east. The odd
OL,8,Fshower possible over western areas of
OL,9,FCentral and Tayside.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,12,Fcloudy Saturday with some showers,
OL,13,FCloudy Sunday with heavier outbreaks
OL,14,Fof rain which will likely continue
OL,15,Finto Monday before clearing later in
OL,16,Fthe day. Breezy at times. Less cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
